---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const project = {
  num: '02',
  title: 'HomeDepot.com E-Commerce Support',
  category: 'Digital Design',
  tags: ['E-Com', 'Digital'],
  year: '2025',
  desc: 'The online marketplace is as competitive as it gets. Our client needed a dedicated team to deliver an extensive list of enhancements for their e-commerce product pages that would increase their search rankings and tell their innovation and brand stories.',
  c1: '#0f2233',
  c2: '#071422',
};
---

<Layout title="6sMaker | Motion Graphics & E-Commerce Design for Home Depot" description="6sMaker created graphics and motion graphics for Ryobi and Ridgid power tools, displayed across Home Depot product pages and seasonal web campaigns.">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="project-hero">
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <video autoplay muted loop playsinline aria-hidden="true">
        <source src="/images/home-depot/HD-Header.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      </video>
      <span class="hero-num">{project.num}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-meta">
        <a href="/portfolio" class="back-link">← All Work</a>
        <div class="meta-tags">
          {project.tags.map(t => <span class="tag">{t}</span>)}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-text">
        <span class="label">{project.category}</span>
        <h1 class="project-title">{project.title}</h1>
        <p class="project-lead">{project.desc}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- OVERVIEW -->
  <section class="section reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="overview-grid">
        <div class="overview-aside">
          <span class="label">Overview</span>
          <div class="aside-line"></div>
          <dl class="project-details">
            <div class="detail-row">
              <dt>Client</dt>
              <dd>RIDGID &amp; RYOBI<br/>Power Tools</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-row">
              <dt>Services</dt>
              <dd>{project.tags.join(', ')}</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-row">
              <dt>Deliverables</dt>
              <dd>
                Variant Images<br/>
                Promotion Graphics<br/>
                Product Launch Images<br/>
                Rich Content
              </dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="overview-body">
          <p class="overview-large">
            ”Add to cart.” – 1.8 billion homedepot.com customers in 2021*
          </p>
          <p>
            The online marketplace is as competitive as it gets. Our client needed a dedicated team to deliver an extensive list of enhancements for their e-commerce product pages that would increase their search rankings and tell their innovation and brand stories. We had a blast digging in to complete thousands of assets that met Home Depot and client requirements, including layout for variant images, banners and multi-media rich content. When our client was recognized by The Home Depot for their digital marketing efforts, we were elated and honored to have made some contributions.
          </p>
          <p>
            * <a href="https://www.statista.com/statistics/318849/number-of-customer-transactions-at-the-home-depot-and-lowe-s-worldwide/" class="source-link">Statista — Home Depot Customer Transactions</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HERO & HOVER PRODUCT IMAGES -->
  <section class="section section--dark reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="label">The Work</span>
      <div class="work-feature">
        <div class="work-feature-text">
          <h2 class="work-feature-title">Hero &amp; Hover Product Images</h2>
          <p>These thumbnails are the first view of your products on the Home Depot category and search results page. Hero images display photography of the main components of the sku, according to Home Depot standards. Hover images appear when the viewer's cursor hovers on the hero image and can contain any content you would like to have appear. In this case, our client shows a side photo angle and the description of each component with branded graphics. Other options for the hover image include: a brand message, promotional offering, environmental photo or top selling points. Hero and Hover images improve the e-commerce user experience, communicate the product offering in search results, and provide a consistent brand experience across your product line.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="work-feature-video">
          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline aria-hidden="true">
