  <!-- RICH CONTENT -->
  <section class="section section--dark reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="work-feature">
        <div class="work-feature-text">
          <h2 class="work-feature-title">Rich Content</h2>
          <p>E-commerce clients love rich media content. Rich content is visually appealing, interesting, educational and provides the customer with important information to influence the buying decision. Home Depot vendors should convey product information, capabilities, pertinent details about warranty and compatibility, and display a strong brand identity. The Home Depot website encourages varied media types, including images, illustrations and gifs. Always important to digital and e-commerce marketing, rich content has associated opportunity for keyword rich copywriting to improve search engine optimization (SEO). Rich content is an excellent tool for exhibiting the reasons to prefer your products and brands over the competition.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
