          <h2 class="work-feature-title">Inline Images</h2>
          <p>Inline images are used on a webpage to present the visitor an option to view content on a different page in an aesthetically appealing way. They function similarly to display ads, with colorful graphics and imagery opportunity and a hyperlink, and they appear within the content of the page instead of the header, footer or sides. Inline images are a great way to increase awareness of a new product launch, share compatible products and advertise holiday promotions and other limited time offers.</p>
